{"title": "EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/Jaecoo-J5-EV-Side-December-2025-Riz-Akhtar-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>EV sales rise sharply in May, hitting a record share of 20 per cent as the Tesla Model Y, the Jaecoo J5, the Geely EX5 and the BYD Sealion 7 led the way, and diesel utes fell sharply.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/03/ev-sales-hit-record-20-pct-share-in-may-as-tesla-byd-jaecoo-and-geely-surge-and-diesel-utes-slump/\">EV sales hit record 20 pct share in May, as Tesla, BYD, Jaecoo and Geely surge and diesel utes slump</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T16:59:09+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too\"><img alt=\"Volkswagen ID.3 windfarm\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"240\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2021/04/vw-windfarms-DB2020AU01189_large-320x240.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"320\" /></a><p>Registrations of new battery electric vehicles surged across Europe in May, and while some countries are showing slower passenger car growth overall, the same cannot be said for EVs.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/ev-sales-numbers-surge-across-europe-in-may-and-their-market-share-too/\">EV sales numbers surge across Europe in May, and their market share too</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T01:46:55+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/Tesla-Model-3-Standard-Tesla-Europe-and-Middle-East-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>The share of electric vehicles in Norway’s new passenger car market came in at 97.8 per cent in May, delivering a 98 per cent share for the first five months of the year. </p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/norways-ev-share-at-97-8-pct-in-may-as-tesla-leads-toyota-and-vw/\">Norway’s EV share at 97.8 pct in May, as Tesla leads Toyota and VW</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-02T01:42:21+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/BYD-Zhengzhou-Melbourne-Dock-Large-380x285.jpeg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>In a first for the Australian EV market, BYD's own ship arrives in Melbourne with thousands of cars to meet the surge in local demand.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/byd-ship-with-more-than-4900-cars-mostly-evs-docks-in-melbourne/\">BYD ship with more than 4,900 cars – mostly EVs – docks in Melbourne</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-01T22:31:10+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues\"><img alt=\"model Y new front\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/tesla-y-driving-front-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Tesla posts best ever monthly sales in Australia, hitting a new peak of 6,443 sales in May, as interest in electric vehicles continued to surge in light of fossil fuel supply crisis.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/tesla-hits-record-month-of-sales-in-may-as-ev-surge-continues/\">Tesla hits record month of sales in May as Australia EV surge continues</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-01T20:53:54+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "Zeekr rolls out first OTA update for 7X electric SUV in Australia", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/zeekr-rolls-out-first-ota-update-for-7x-electric-suv-in-australia/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/zeekr-rolls-out-first-ota-update-for-7x-electric-suv-in-australia/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Zeekr rolls out first OTA update for 7X electric SUV in Australia\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Zeekr-7X-Deliveries-Car-Line-Up-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Zeekr has rolled out the first over-the-air software update for its 7X electric SUV in Australia, adding remote parking, digital key access and improved Apple CarPlay functionality.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/02/zeekr-rolls-out-first-ota-update-for-7x-electric-suv-in-australia/\">Zeekr rolls out first OTA update for 7X electric SUV in Australia</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-06-01T18:14:26+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "Australian energy giant signs up car subscription platform to manage EV fleet and V2G", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-energy-giant-signs-up-car-subscription-platform-to-manage-ev-fleet-and-v2g/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-energy-giant-signs-up-car-subscription-platform-to-manage-ev-fleet-and-v2g/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Australian energy giant signs up car subscription platform to manage EV fleet and V2G\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/KarmoCar-3-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Australia’s largest car subscription platform signs deal with energy giant to manage its electric car subscription fleet and platform operations, and to explore rollout of V2G.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-energy-giant-signs-up-car-subscription-platform-to-manage-ev-fleet-and-v2g/\">Australian energy giant signs up car subscription platform to manage EV fleet and V2G</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-31T22:21:42+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
{"title": "Australian firm debuts vehicle-to-vehicle fast charging platform for stranded and remote EV drivers", "link": "https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-firm-debuts-vehicle-to-vehicle-fast-charging-platform-for-stranded-and-remote-ev-drivers/", "summary": "<a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-firm-debuts-vehicle-to-vehicle-fast-charging-platform-for-stranded-and-remote-ev-drivers/\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"Australian firm debuts vehicle-to-vehicle fast charging platform for stranded and remote EV drivers\"><img alt=\"\" class=\"webfeedsFeaturedVisual wp-post-image\" height=\"285\" src=\"https://thedriven.io/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/Alpine-Energy-MGEN-M40-380x285.jpg\" style=\"display: block; margin-bottom: 5px; clear: both;\" width=\"380\" /></a><p>Australian energy and technology company has debuted a potentially first-of-its-kind vehicle-to-vehicle DC fast charging platform, for stranded drivers or for remote mining operations.</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://thedriven.io/2026/06/01/australian-firm-debuts-vehicle-to-vehicle-fast-charging-platform-for-stranded-and-remote-ev-drivers/\">Australian firm debuts vehicle-to-vehicle fast charging platform for stranded and remote EV drivers</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://thedriven.io\">The Driven</a>.</p>", "published": "2026-05-31T21:26:43+00:00", "source": "The Driven", "category": "mobility", "matched_entities": {}, "logged_at": "2026-06-03T09:21:48.020599+00:00"}
